// AWS IAM Customer Managed Policy Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects creation of a new customer-managed IAM policy (CreatePolicy). Attackers craft permissive policies to attach later; inspect the…
// False positives: Routine policy authoring by platform/IaC.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-create-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "CreatePolicy" and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com"
